    "Description": "\"Remember me\" cookie age is not verified on the server. This potentially allows an attacker to intercept a valid cookie and reuse it indefinitely, even after the configured expiration time has passed.\nThis issue affects all Apache Shiro versions from 1.2.4 through 2.x, and 3.0.0-alpha-1, only when RememberMe functionality is enabled.\n\n\nUpgrade to version 3.0.0 or later, which fixes the issue.",
    "Origin": "UNSPECIFIED",
    "PublishedAt": "2026-06-25T09:31:23Z",
    "Severity": "LOW",
    "Summary": "Apache Shiro's \"remember me\" cookie age is not verified on the server.",
